concreteSpec:
EDITS, file:line exact.

1) js/config.js — add two constants near CLAWS_MULT (line 36):
   COLLECTION_FULL_MULT: 64,            // 2^6 — full 20/20 collection target (Σbonus===63)
   ACTIVE_DOUBLE_COUNT: true,           // Option B: active form's own bonus counts twice (felt switch)
   Add a `formBonus` numeric field to EVERY entry in Cfg.FORMS (config.js:108-258). Values in perFormNumbers. Keep `base` as a NO-OP legacy field (do NOT delete — entities.js facing-geom uses an unrelated fm.base sprite field; deleting form.base is safe but leave it to minimize diff and let any stray reader fall back gracefully).

2) js/economy.js:107-111 — replace attackPower() body:
   function attackPower() {
     var s = 0, ids = state.ownedFormIds;
     for (var i = 0; i < ids.length; i++) { var f = formDef(ids[i]); if (f) s += (f.formBonus || 0); }
     var af = formDef(state.activeFormId);
     if (Cfg.ACTIVE_DOUBLE_COUNT && af) s += (af.formBonus || 0);   // Option B felt-switch
     return Cfg.START_ATTACK * Math.pow(Cfg.CLAWS_MULT, state.clawsLevel) * (1 + s);
   }

3) js/economy.js:181-185 — clawsCost() MUST carry the same multiplier so the bounded invariant holds. Replace body:
   function clawsCost() {
     var s = 0, ids = state.ownedFormIds;
     for (var i = 0; i < ids.length; i++) { var f = formDef(ids[i]); if (f) s += (f.formBonus || 0); }
     var af = formDef(state.activeFormId);
     if (Cfg.ACTIVE_DOUBLE_COUNT && af) s += (af.formBonus || 0);
     return Math.round(Cfg.START_ATTACK * Math.pow(Cfg.CLAWS_MULT, state.clawsLevel + 1) * (1 + s));
   }
   (Extract the Σ loop into a private collectionMult() helper memoized in afterPurchase()/switchForm()/load() to avoid the O(20) scan in both at 60Hz — attackPower is hit per attack via entities.js. Recompute the cache on every ownedFormIds OR activeFormId change.)

4) js/economy.js:557-558 (buildUpgrades next-power preview) — replace the inline `base * Math.pow(...)` nxtPow calc to read the same collectionMult so the shop preview matches.

5) js/economy.js:679, 748, 764 — reword the three shop subtitle strings from 'base N attack' to the collection-contribution wording in perFormNumbers (UI is load-bearing — without it the always-worth-it value is invisible).

6) Add a boot-time assert in config.js or game.js boot: console.assert(Σ formBonus === 63, 'formBonus drift') so a future World-2 edit can't silently break the clean ×64 rebate.

7) NO change needed to canFinale() (:194), buyClaws cap-deny (:254), CAP_HP (:24), or finaleStats (:202-211) — they read attackPower() transparently. NO base re-pricing of unlock COSTS.
